{"root":"parang","ipa":"/paˈraŋ/","core":"一种大型的砍刀或山刀，常用于砍伐热带丛林的灌木和树枝。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/paˈraŋ/","zh":"砍刀、山刀","phrases":[{"t":"parang panjang","zh":"长砍刀"},{"t":"bilah parang","zh":"刀身"},{"t":"gagang parang","zh":"刀柄"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia membawa parang untuk membuka jalan di hutan.","zh":"他带着一把砍刀在森林里开路。"},{"t":"Petani itu menggunakan parang untuk membersihkan kebun.","zh":"农夫用砍刀清理果园。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"parang","ipa":"/paˈraŋ/","zh":"砍刀","phrase":{"t":"menetak dengan parang","zh":"用砍刀砍"},"example":{"t":"Parang itu sangat tajam.","zh":"那把砍刀非常锋利。"}},{"w":"memparang","ipa":"/məmˈpa.raŋ/","zh":"用砍刀砍","phrase":{"t":"memparang kayu","zh":"用砍刀砍木头"},"example":{"t":"Dia memparang dahan yang menghalangi jalan.","zh":"他用砍刀砍断了挡路的树枝。"}},{"w":"terparang","ipa":"/tərˈpa.raŋ/","zh":"被砍刀误伤","phrase":{"t":"terparang kaki","zh":"脚被砍刀误伤"},"example":{"t":"Kakinya terparang karena ceroboh.","zh":"由于粗心，他的脚被砍刀误伤了。"}},{"w":"parangan","ipa":"/paˈra.ŋan/","zh":"刀痕，砍痕","phrase":{"t":"bekas parangan","zh":"砍痕"},"example":{"t":"Terdapat bekas parangan di batang pohon itu.","zh":"那棵树的树干上有砍痕。"}}],"derSlugs":["parang","memparang","terparang","parangan"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T17:33:58.524Z","src":"base"}